### 1. GET all recipes
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/recipes
Authorization: Basic admin admin
Accept: application/json
###

### 2. GET recipe by id
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/recipes/1
Authorization: Basic admin admin
Accept: application/json
###

### 3. GET all recipes - bad username (expect 401)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/recipes
Authorization: Basic admin1 admin
Accept: application/json
###

### 4. GET all recipes - no Authorization header (expect 401)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/recipes
Accept: application/json
###

### 5. POST create a recipe
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/recipes
Authorization: Basic admin admin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "5",
  "name": "Банош",
  "description": "Гуцульська кукурудзяна каша на сметані з бринзою та шкварками",
  "cookingTimeMinutes": 30,
  "difficulty": "Легкий"
}
###

### 6. GET all recipes - confirm recipe was created
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/recipes
Authorization: Basic admin admin
Accept: application/json
###

### 7. GET recipe by id - the newly created one
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/recipes/5
Authorization: Basic admin admin
Accept: application/json
###

### 8. PUT update the newly created recipe
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/recipes/5
Authorization: Basic admin admin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "5",
  "name": "Банош з бринзою",
  "description": "Гуцульська кукурудзяна каша на сметані, подається з бринзою та шкварками",
  "cookingTimeMinutes": 35,
  "difficulty": "Середній"
}
###

### 9. DELETE the recipe
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/recipes/5
Authorization: Basic admin admin
###

### 10. GET recipe by id - confirm it was deleted (expect 404)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/recipes/5
Authorization: Basic admin admin
Accept: application/json
###
